before:
Complete local C example; the app itself does not execute it:
```c
#include <stdio.h>
int main(void) {
    int choice = 1;
    switch (choice) {
        case 1: puts("one"); break;
        case 2: puts("two"); break;
        default: puts("other");
    }
    return 0;
}

```

